  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance for Informed, Safe and Dignified Voluntary Returns of Vulnerable Migrants in Participating Countries of the Americas (WHA Regional AVR Program)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide administrative, logistic and financial support to vulnerable migrants in North, Central and South America who are unable or do not want to remain in host countries and that voluntarily want to return to their origin country or country of habitual residence</narrative>
  </description>
